>I wasn't paying much attention to the "stuck at level 29 or so"
>discussion, and now I find I'm stuck there myself.  My pick-axe won't get
>through the floor, so how do I get down?

******SPOILER********

(But I think everybody knows this anyway.)
You have to be fire resistant.  You put on a ring of teleport control.
Quaff a potion of confusion.  Read a scroll of teleportation.
Since you are confused, you mispronounce the magic words...-more-
To what level would you like to teleport?  (say 39)
You arrive at the center of the earth...-more-
Unfortunately, it is there that hell is located. -more-
